# Spawn a new box of the given size at the given world-frame position into
# gripper_manager's round-robin slot pool - see gripper_manager.py and
# group_a_description/urdf/group_a_macro.xacro's gripper_slot comment for
# why a fixed slot pool exists at all (DetachableJoint's own child_model is
# a static string baked into the URDF at build time, not retargetable at
# runtime).

float64 width
float64 depth
float64 height
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
---
bool success
string message
